Lemma "user/Lemma 0: Power Lock (GFL active-power equilibrium)".
"  ==>  \forall Pref (\forall Vg (\forall id1 (\forall id2 (\forall dw1 (\forall dw2 ((((Vg) > ((0)))&((((Pref)-(((((3))/((2)))*(Vg))*(id1))) = ((0)))&(((Pref)-(((((3))/((2)))*(Vg))*(id2))) = ((0)))))->((id1) = (id2))))))))
\qed::03cd86f9399868292da83e89e586e574"
